<div id="S3.SS1.2" class="ltx_proof">
<h6 class="ltx_title ltx_runin ltx_font_italic ltx_title_proof">Proof.</h6>
<div id="S3.SS1.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S3.SS1.p2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.p2.1.1" class="ltx_text">At the vertex <math id="S3.SS1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
<table id="S3.Ex27" class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_table">

<tbody><tr class="ltx_equation ltx_eqn_row ltx_align_baseline">
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padleft"></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_align_center"><math id="S3.Ex27.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\Delta e_{x}(x)=-d_{x},\qquad\Delta e_{x}(y)=1\quad(y\sim x),\qquad\Gamma(f,e_{x})(x)=-\frac{1}{2}\Delta f(x)." display="block" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="2.167em">,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">Γ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0em">=</mo><mo lspace="0em">−</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mi>f</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta e_{x}(x)=-d_{x},\qquad\Delta e_{x}(y)=1\quad(y\sim x),\qquad\Gamma(f,e_{x})(x)=-\frac{1}{2}\Delta f(x).</annotation></semantics></math></td>
<td class="ltx_eqn_cell ltx_eqn_center_padright"></td></tr></tbody>
</table>
<p id="S3.SS1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.SS1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="S3.SS1.p2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y\sim x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>∼</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y\sim x</annotation></semantics></math>, only the edge from <math id="S3.SS1.p2.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="y" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>y</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">y</annotation></semantics></math> to <math id="S3.SS1.p2.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>x</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x</annotation></semantics></math> contributes to the <math id="S3.SS1.p2.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="e_{x}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>e</mi><mi>x</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">e_{x}</annotation></semantics></math>-difference, and hence</span></p>
