<p id="S4.SS2.p7.6" class="ltx_p"><span id="S4.SS2.p7.6.1" class="ltx_text">which is impossible because the left-hand side is strictly smaller than <math id="S4.SS2.p7.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="1/C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">1/C</annotation></semantics></math>.
∎</span></p>
