<p id="S6.SS1.p3.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p3.4.1" class="ltx_text">Substitution into the preceding integral proves (<a href="#S6.E80" title="In Lemma 6.1 (Reverse Poincaré and heat-kernel row contraction). ‣ 6.1. Heat-kernel row contraction and exit-time control ‣ 6. Heat-kernel localisation for Poincaré inequalities ‣ Nonnegative Bakry–Émery Curvature on Bounded-Degree Graphs Implies Volume Doubling and Poincaré Inequalities" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">80</span></a>).
