<p id="S6.SS1.p7.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.SS1.p7.1.1" class="ltx_text">On the event <math id="S6.SS1.p7.m1" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="\{\tau_{R}\leq t\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\{\tau_{R}\leq t\}</annotation></semantics></math>, set <math id="S6.SS1.p7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="Z:=X_{\tau_{R}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>Z</mi><mo>:=</mo><msub><mi>X</mi><msub><mi>τ</mi><mi>R</mi></msub></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">Z:=X_{\tau_{R}}</annotation></semantics></math>. If also
