<p id="S6.Thmtheorem3.p1.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="S6.Thmtheorem3.p1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">Fix <math id="S6.Thmtheorem3.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="o\in V" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">o\in V</annotation></semantics></math> and an integer <math id="S6.Thmtheorem3.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r\geq 1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>≥</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r\geq 1</annotation></semantics></math>. Put</span></p>
