<p id="S7.p3.7" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p3.7.1" class="ltx_text">Since <math id="S7.p3.m12" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B(o,r)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>o</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B(o,r)</annotation></semantics></math> is finite, choose a maximal <math id="S7.p3.m13" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2s" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2s</annotation></semantics></math>-separated set</span></p>
