<p id="S7.p3.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p3.10.1" class="ltx_text">and the balls <math id="S7.p3.m16" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B(x_{i},s)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B(x_{i},s)</annotation></semantics></math> are pairwise disjoint.
