<p id="S7.p3.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="S7.p3.12.1" class="ltx_text">For every <math id="S7.p3.m17" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>,</span></p>
