<p id="A1.p2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A1.p2.2.1" class="ltx_text">For <math id="A1.p2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t&lt;T" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t&lt;T</annotation></semantics></math>, write</span></p>
